# Publish everything

If the user asks to **publish everything**, **publish all**, or redeploy Tune Book + YogApp together:

1. Run from the abc2book repo root (do **not** invent a parallel deploy path):

```bash
npm run publish:everything
```

Optional flags the user may want:

- `--dry-run` — print steps only
- `--no-android` — web/Pages only
- `--no-push` / `--no-commit` — build without publishing
- `--install` — also `adb install` both APKs
- `--wait-pages` — poll GitHub Pages after push

Script: `scripts/publish-everything.sh`

It builds YogApp Android, Tune Book Android, Tune Book web (embeds `/yoga/`), commits, and pushes **yogapp** then **abc2book** so https://tunebook.net/ and https://tunebook.net/yoga/ update.
